d " [:a {:href "/athletes/94404"} "Jenny Johnson-Jordan"] ". But with all Olympic matches now best of three sets, there were no upsets in Athina. May and Walsh won easily, never losing a set. In the final they faced the Brazilian pair " [:a {:href "/athletes/94352"} "Adriana Behar"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/94351"} "Shelda"] ", who they had supplanted as the dominant pair on the beach. The first set was fairly close at 21-17, but May/Walsh put the hammer down in the second set, winning 21-11."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button799374", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button799374').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Matches Played"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sets"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Faults"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Aces"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Fastest Serve"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Block Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Dig Successes"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "United States 1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "7"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "7"] [:td {:class "split", :